#. ３人だけじゃないよ…
#. その証拠だったら、ボクも持ってるんだ…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's not just you three. I have evidence, too."
msgstr ""

#. はぁ！？　苗木っちもか！？
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What!? You too!?"
msgstr ""

#. みんなが言ってる証拠って、
#. この<CLT 3>集合写真<CLT>の事だよね？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The evidence you're all referring to is this <CLT 3>group\n"
"photo<CLT>, right?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…そうだけど…
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "W-Well, yeah..."
msgstr ""

#. …あれ？　でも違う！！
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...Huh? Wait, but mine's different!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、苗木の持ってる写真には、
#. 私が写ってるけど…
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "With the picture you have...I'm in it!"
msgstr ""

#. そんなのおかしいよ！
#. だって、私が持ってる写真には…
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But that can't be right! Cuz in my picture..."
msgstr ""

#. ほら、私だけが写ってないんだよ！？
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "See? I'm the only one not in it!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり、そうだったのか。
#. だとすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I figured as much. In which case...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠クン、キミも写真を持ってるんだよね？
#. それを見せてくれない！？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hiro, you have a picture too, right? Let's see it!"
msgstr ""

#. いいけど、丁重に扱えよ…
#. 貴重な証拠だからな…
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"O-Okay, but be careful with it. It's pretty important\n"
"evidence..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この写真も…！
#. やっぱり、思った通りだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This one, too...! It's just like I thought!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 見えてきたみたいだよ…
#. この写真に隠された<CLT 3>秘密<CLT>がさ…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So the <CLT 3>secret<CLT> in these pictures has been revealed..."
msgstr ""

#. 秘密も何もオメーらがグルってだけだろ！？
#. だから、一緒に写ってたんだろ！？
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Secret or whatever, I don't care! You guys are all in\n"
"on this together! That's why I'm the only one missing!"
msgstr ""

#. 私の写真には、あんただって写ってるんだよ！？
msgctxt "0015 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But you're in my picture!"
msgstr ""

#. あんた達の方こそ、
#. みんなして私を騙してるんじゃん！！
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You're the ones trying to trick me!"
msgstr ""

#. そうなんだ…そうやって争う事こそが、
#. この写真の目的だったんだ…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So the whole purpose behind these photos was to get us\n"
"questioning and fighting with each other..."
msgstr ""

#. 自分以外の全員が組んでいる…
#. ボク達にそう思わせる為の<CLT 3>黒幕の罠<CLT>なんだよ！
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The <CLT 3>mastermind laid a trap<CLT> to make us each think\n"
"everyone else was working against us!"
msgstr ""

#. へ…？　ボクの罠…？
msgctxt "0019 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Huh? I laid a trap?"
msgstr ""

#. 罠とは失礼しちゃうなー！
#. それって、どういう根拠で言ってるのさ！？
msgctxt "0020 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"A trap!? How rude! What grounds do you have for such\n"
"audacious accusations!?"
msgstr ""

#. 写真を受け取った本人
msgctxt "0021 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The ones who got the photos"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマ
msgctxt "0022 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Monokuma"
msgstr ""

#. それはね…
msgctxt "0023 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Oh, well ya see..."
msgstr ""

#. みんなが楽しそうに写真を撮っていたその時…
#. ボクは冬に備えて鮭を取りに行ってたからなんだ…
msgctxt "0024 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"While you guys were having so much fun frolicking\n"
"together, I was out catching salmon for the winter!"
msgstr ""

#. 以上！
msgctxt "0025 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "That's all there is to it!"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマの言ってることはともかくよ…
#. なんでモノクマが写ってないことが罠なんだべ？
msgctxt "0026 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Ignoring what he actually said, how is Monokuma not\n"
"being in the pictures a trap?"
msgstr ""

#. アイツは生徒じゃねーんだ。
#. 写ってなくてもおかしくないべ？
msgctxt "0027 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"He's not a student here, so it'd actually be weird if\n"
"he WAS in the pictures, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん…
#. 罠とは関係ないみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You're right... I guess that's not I meant...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 腐川冬子
msgctxt "0030 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Toko"
msgstr ""

#. そう…そういう事ね…
#. あたしだけ除けものなのね…
msgctxt "0031 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "S-See? I'm the only one who g-got left out...!"
msgstr ""

#. 見るに堪えないブスは写すな…
#. みんなそう思ってるんだわ…
msgctxt "0032 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I don't like seeing her i-in real life, why would I\n"
"want her in my picture? That's what you th-thought!"
msgstr ""

#. アハ…写真を撮ることすら許されないなんて…
#. アハッ…アフフッ…
msgctxt "0033 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Haha... Even a s-single picture isn't allowed?\n"
"Aha...hahahehuheehue..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…落ち着いて写真を見てみると、
#. 腐川さんはちゃんと写ってるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Although, if we all calm down and look at the\n"
"photos...Toko's totally in all of them.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. うぷぷ…ないない！
msgctxt "0036 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhu... No way!"
msgstr ""

#. 根拠なんてないんだよ！！
msgctxt "0037 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "No grounds! No grounds! You have NO GROUNDS!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どの写真にも…写っていない人物が存在してる…
#. それが根拠になるんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When you look at each photo, there's someone who\n"
"doesn't appear... *That's* my proof!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>モノクマの罠…その根拠となるのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The proof I need to reveal Monokuma's trap...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この集合写真に隠された法則だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Each photo has a certain something in common.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなの集合写真には、
#. 共通して、<CLT><CLT 3>ある人物だけ<CLT><CLT 4>が写っていないんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a connection regarding <CLT><CLT 3>what person<CLT><CLT 4> isn't\n"
"shown in the group photos.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その人物って言うのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And that person is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. その集合写真には、
#. <CLT 3>受け取った本人だけが<CLT>写ってなかったんだ。
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In each case, the only one not in the picture is <CLT 3>the\n"
"person who received it<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ボクが受け取った写真には、
#. ボクだけが写ってなかったし…
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So, in the picture I got, I'm the only one missing."
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さんの受け取った写真には、
#. 彼女だけが写ってなかった…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "In the picture Hina got, she's the only one missing."
msgstr ""

#. そして、葉隠クンが受け取った写真には、
#. 彼だけが写ってなかった…
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And in the picture Hiro got, he's the only one\n"
"missing."
msgstr ""

#. ついでに…俺が受け取った写真も見せてやろうか？
msgctxt "0048 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"As long as we're talking about it, I suppose I should\n"
"show you my photo, as well."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、モノクマがボク達に渡したのは、
#. その<CLT 3>本人だけが写ってない集合写真<CLT>だったんだ。
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In other words, Monokuma gave each of us a <CLT 3>group\n"
"photo in which that person wasn't included<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 俺らは…そんな写真を見せられたせいで…
#. 全員が敵だと思い込んでたんか…？
msgctxt "0050 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"And when we each saw our picture, we just assumed\n"
"everyone else was the enemy...?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…バレた？
msgctxt "0051 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu... Figured it out, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. こんな事だと思っていたわ…
#. 何がヒントよ…
msgctxt "0052 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I thought that must be it. But how was that a\n"
"hint?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>いや、でも…
#. モノクマの罠…ってだけでもないのかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But you know...there might be more to this than just\n"
"Monokuma trying to confuse us...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなの集合写真…
#. 何か…他にも<CLT><CLT 3>気になるところ<CLT><CLT 4>があったような…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's <CLT><CLT 3>something else<CLT><CLT 4> that bothers me about\n"
"everyone's pictures...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだ…？　何が引っ掛かったんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What is it? What's digging at me...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あのさ…みんなの集合写真…
#. もう１度見せてくれないかな？
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Listen, can I see everyone's group photo one more\n"
"time?"
msgstr ""

#. 今の話とは直接関係ないと思うんだけど…
#. ちょっと、確認しておきたい事があるんだよ。
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's not directly connected to what we're talking\n"
"about, but I'd like to double-check something..."
msgstr ""

#. 別に、俺は構わんべ。
msgctxt "0059 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Sure, no problem."
msgstr ""

#. 私もいいけど…
msgctxt "0060 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah, I don't mind."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この集合写真には、
#. 確かに、<CLT><CLT 3>不自然な点<CLT><CLT 4>があったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure there's <CLT><CLT 3>something unusual<CLT><CLT 4> about these group\n"
"photos...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それが何か…
#. もう１度、注意深く見比べてみよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What is it? I need to compare each of them one more\n"
"time.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンの受け取った写真…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Byakuya's picture...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんの受け取った写真…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina's picture...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンの受け取った写真…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro's picture...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、ボクの写真…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And mine...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり引っ掛かる…何か<CLT><CLT 3>不自然<CLT><CLT 4>だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's something <CLT><CLT 3>strange<CLT><CLT 4> about all of them.\n"
"Something I can't quite pin down...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何かが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>集合写真<CLT><CLT 23>を更新しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Group Photo<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been updated in the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木っち、そんな写真なんて、
#. もうほっとけって！
msgctxt "0071 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Can you just forget about the photo already?"
msgstr ""

#. ぐぐ…それにしてもムカツクべ！
#. そんなねつ造写真で、俺を騙そうとするなんてよ…！
msgctxt "0072 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Grr... Trying to trick me with such an obviously fake\n"
"photo... I'm still pissed about that!"
msgstr ""

#. しかも、お揃いの制服なんて手が込み過ぎだし！
msgctxt "0073 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And on top of that, they went to all that trouble to\n"
"make it look like we were wearing matching uniforms!"
msgstr ""

#. …ん？　ねつ造？
msgctxt "0074 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Hmm? So you think they're fake?"
msgstr ""

#. いやいや、あれ自体は<CLT 3>本物<CLT>だけど？
msgctxt "0075 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "No no no, I assure you, they're <CLT 3>quite real<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. な、何言ってんの！？　そんな訳ないじゃん！
msgctxt "0076 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wh-What are you talking about!? There's no way!"
msgstr ""

#. そうだべ！　俺はあんな写真なんか撮った記憶ねーぞ！
msgctxt "0077 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Yeah! I don't remember ever taking a picture like\n"
"that!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、ねつ造って事じゃねーか！
#. 間違いねーっての！！
msgctxt "0078 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So it's gotta be a fake! I'm sure of it!"
msgstr ""

#. でもさ…本当にそうなのかな…？
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But you know... Can we really be so sure?"
msgstr ""

#. …は？
msgctxt "0080 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. 確かに、あんな写真を撮った記憶なんて…
#. ボクにもないけど…
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Don't get me wrong. I don't remember taking this\n"
"picture, either. But..."
msgstr ""

#. だから、ねつ造だって…
#. 本当に…そう言い切れるのかな…？
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Is that really enough to be absolutely positive\n"
"they're fake?"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どういう意味…？
msgctxt "0083 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-What do you mean...?"
msgstr ""
